  "description_html": "FILE TRANSFER FROM LOCAL TO COMMONS (<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Drbogdan\" title=\"User:Drbogdan\">Drbogdan</a> (<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User_talk:Drbogdan\" title=\"User talk:Drbogdan\"><span class=\"signature-talk\">talk</span></a>) 14:40, 22 March 2019 (UTC))\n<p><a class=\"external free\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Fossil-AvimaiaSchweitzeraeWithUnlaidEgg.jpg#filehistory\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Fossil-AvimaiaSchweitzeraeWithUnlaidEgg.jpg#filehistory</a>\n</p><p><br>\nThis is a picture of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Avimaia_schweitzerae\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Avimaia schweitzerae\">Avimaia schweitzerae</a>, first bird fossil found with an unlaid egg, taken by Barbara Marrs.<sup id=\"cite_ref-NC-20190320_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NC-20190320-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-SCI-20190320_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SCI-20190320-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-NG-20190320_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-NG-20190320-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br>\n</p><p><i>Original publication'</i>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.sciencemag.org/news/2019/03/unlaid-egg-discovered-ancient-bird-fossil\">https://www.sciencemag.org/news/2019/03/unlaid-egg-discovered-ancient-bird-fossil</a><br>\n<b>Immediate source:</b> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.sciencemag.org/sites/default/files/styles/inline__699w__no_aspect/public/fossil_16x9_1.jpg?itok=m6bXq8Qz\">https://www.sciencemag.org/sites/default/files/styles/inline__699w__no_aspect/public/fossil_16x9_1.jpg?itok=m6bXq8Qz</a>\n</p><p>Please see =&gt; <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.natu